559
00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:49.800
I believe so.

560
00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:51.600
It was first half of the day for sure.

561
00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.100
So you guys are like, good morning.

562
00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:53.720
How are you?

563
00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:54.480
Nice to meet you.

564
00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.280
Let's kiss.

565
00:17:55.280 --> 00:18:01.100
Yeah, and of course, you know, whenever you have to kiss someone, it's always like,

566
00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:04.700
just adds to the nerves a little bit, even though it's just acting.

567
00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.160
It's still like, oh my God.

568
00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:11.500
And it wasn't like this crazy smooch or anything, but it's like a very intimate thing to do.

569
00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:11.920
Yeah.

570
00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:16.280
To just put your lips on someone else's lips within like four minutes of meeting them.

571
00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:16.860
Yeah.

572
00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:17.540
A little bit.

573
00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:18.200
Yeah.

574
00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.240
And I remember, of course, being nervous about that, but not saying anything.

575
00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:22.120
Just do it.

576
00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:22.760
Be professional.

577
00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:27.220
Be professional, but it's always like, oh my gosh, this is like, this job is so crazy.

578
00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.000
So crazy.

579
00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:32.460
And even something as simple as that, I even remember being nervous too, because I'm standing

580
00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.520
up and I have to kind of like hunch around to get to you.

581
00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:41.020
And I'm like, God, just don't like accidentally kiss his eye or like part of his cheek.

582
00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.120
Like just land it.

583
00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:43.260
Just land it, Jenna.

584
00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:44.620
It was a walk-in kiss.

585
00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:45.260
It was.

586
00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:45.500
It was.

587
00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.700
It was like a drive-by kiss.

588
00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:47.200
Yeah.

589
00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:47.740
Yeah.

590
00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:48.260
Exactly.

591
00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.340
Roy.

592
00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:54.400
Yep.

593
00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:55.100
Jim.

594
00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:55.700
Mm-hmm.

595
00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:56.480
And Steve.

596
00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.580
But everybody calls you Agent Jim.

597
00:18:59.000 --> 00:18:59.160
Yeah.

598
00:18:59.320 --> 00:18:59.460
Yeah.

599
00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:01.220
I think that's what it's like credited as.

